        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Maggie Q, Margaret Denise Quigley, Len Wiseman, Bruce Willis, John McClane, Will Kemp, Sylvester McCoy, William Hope\n- Works: Live Free or Die Hard, Nikita, Slumber\n- Roles: actress, model, director, title role\n\nFacts:\n- Margaret Denise Quigley was born on May 22, 1979, and is professionally known as Maggie Q.\n- Maggie Q is an American actress and model.\n- From 2010 to 2013, Maggie Q played the title role in The CW action-thriller series Nikita.\n- Maggie Q is known for starring in the action film Live Free or Die Hard.\n- Live Free or Die Hard was directed by Len Wiseman.\n- In Live Free or Die Hard, Bruce Willis stars as John McClane.\n- Slumber stars Maggie Q, Will Kemp, Sylvester McCoy, and William Hope.",
